  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 889f96ad8236a48fe94c1785630aa4b7, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::WillExe.WillAssembler
  fragmentCounter: {fileID: 1955334729}
  hintToast: {fileID: 1597297282}
  hintToastText: {fileID: 1311184663}
  winPanel: {fileID: 2118123703}
  winWillText: {fileID: 1081281188}
  losePanel: {fileID: 2050194442}
  winRestartButton: {fileID: 138096781}
  winBootButton: {fileID: 507273302}
  loseRestartButton: {fileID: 226863487}
  fullWillText: '<b>LAST WILL AND TESTAMENT of [REDACTED]</b>


    so. if you''re
    reading this, i''m finally done. good for me.


    the swiss vault. it''s yours.
    ~$240M untraceable, 31kg of rough diamonds. combination''s taped behind my high
    school yearbook, the one with the cracked spine. you''ll know which.


    the
    black book, original, also yours. forty years i sat on it. never used it once.
    that''s the family record and i''d like you to try and beat it. if you can''t,
    at least don''t embarrass me.


    the island, yes THAT one, is already rubble.
    i paid $5M up front to have it bulldozed and the ground salted. don''t visit.
    don''t drive past. i mean it.


    biscuit''s collar is in my desk, top-left
    drawer. he was a good dog. the best one.


    keep posting the minion memes.
    the facebook, the dogecoin wallet, the chain emails, all of it. a man who looks
    like a harmless idiot online buys himself a lot of cover. don''t throw that away.


    the
    swap in ''94 was the one clean thing i ever did. i don''t regret any of the rest.
    that one i''m proud of.


    run it better than i did. or burn it all down.
    either one, i''ll understand.


    - grandpa


    <size=80%><color=#C06060>PS:
    they come for you in 48 hours. my enemies are yours now. welcome to the family
    business.</color></size>


    <size=80%><color=#C06060>PPS: epstein didn''t
    kill himself. i did. he was getting sloppy.</color></size>'
